{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55692","headline":"悟空塔 · 赞宁","name":"悟空塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮图萧瑟入虚空，一聚全身罔像中。\n传马祖心开佛印，识龙潜主示神通。\n毫光委坠江楼月，道气馨香海岸风。\n此地化缘才始尽，更於何处动魔宫？\n（《海昌胜蹟志》卷一。\n此首承陶敏先生录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赞宁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}